  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\nGiven: 19 + 125 ÷ 25 – 100 ÷ 5 + 4 × 3 = 52480÷0.3×5+500190+9×27÷1.6=2\" id=\"MathJax-Element-9-Frame\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"display: inline; position: relative;\" tabindex=\"0\">480÷0.3×5+500190+9×27÷1.6=2\" id=\"MathJax-Element-1-Frame\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"position: relative;\" tabindex=\"0\">480÷0.3×5+500190+9×27÷1.6=2480÷0.3×5+500190+9×27÷1.6=2\n480÷0.3×5+500190+9×27÷1.6=2\n\nAccording to the question, after interchanging the numbers:\n\nOption 1): 19 and 4\n\n19 + 125 ÷ 25 – 100 ÷ 5 + 4 × 3 = 52 ⇒ 4 + 125 ÷ 25 – 100 ÷ 5 + 19 × 3 = 52\n\n⇒ 4 + __**125 ÷ 25**__ – __**100 ÷ 5**__ + 19 × 3 = 52\n\n⇒ 4 + 5 – 20 + __**19 × 3**__ = 52\n\n⇒ __**4 + 5 + 57**__ – 20 = 52\n\n⇒ __**66 – 20**__ = 52\n\n⇒ 46 ≠ 52 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 2): 125 and 100\n\n19 + 125 ÷ 25 – 100 ÷ 5 + 4 × 3 = 52 ⇒ 19 + 100 ÷ 25 – 125 ÷ 5 + 4 × 3 = 52\n\n⇒ 19 + __**100 ÷ 25**__ – __**125 ÷ 5**__ + 4 × 3 = 52\n\n⇒ 19 + 4 – 25 + __**4 × 3**__ = 52\n\n⇒ __**19 + 4 + 12**__ – 25 = 52\n\n⇒ __35** – 25**__ = 52\n\n⇒ 10 ≠ 52 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 3): 25 and 5480÷0.3×5+500190+9×27÷1.6=2\" id=\"MathJax-Element-20-Frame\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"display: inline; position: relative;\" tabindex=\"0\">\n\n19 + 125 ÷ 25 – 100 ÷ 5 + 4 × 3 = 52 ⇒ 19 + 125 ÷ 5 – 100 ÷ 25 + 4 × 3 = 52\n\n⇒ 19 + __**125 ÷ 5**__ – __**100 ÷ 25**__ + 4 × 3 = 52\n\n⇒ 19 + 25 – 4 + __**4 × 3**__ = 52\n\n⇒ __**19 + 25 + 12**__ – 4 = 52\n\n⇒ __**56 – 4**__ = 52\n\n⇒ 52 = 52 (LHS = RHS)\n\nOption 4): 4 and 5480÷0.3×5+500190+9×27÷1.6=2\" id=\"MathJax-Element-25-Frame\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"display: inline; position: relative;\" tabindex=\"0\">\n\n19 + 125 ÷ 25 – 100 ÷ 5 + 4 × 3 = 52 ⇒ 19 + 125 ÷ 25 – 100 ÷ 4 + 5 × 3 = 52\n\n⇒ 19 + __**125 ÷ 25**__ – __**100 ÷ 4**__ + 5 × 3 = 52\n\n⇒ 19 + 5 – 25 + __**5 × 3**__** **= 52\n\n⇒ __**19 + 5 + 15**__ – 25 = 52\n\n⇒ __**39 – 25**__ = 52\n\n⇒ 14 ≠ 52 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option 3\" is the correct answer.\n\n54",
